# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# Handles HTTP→HTTPS and www→non-www at the edge.
# Cloudflare Pages processes this file automatically for static deployments.

# www → non-www (permanent 301)
https://www.vmingle.in/* https://vmingle.in/:splat 301

# HTTP → HTTPS (permanent 301)
# Note: Cloudflare also handles this via SSL/TLS → "Always Use HTTPS"
# This _redirects file serves as a belt-and-suspenders fallback.
http://vmingle.in/* https://vmingle.in/:splat 301
http://www.vmingle.in/* https://vmingle.in/:splat 301
